NO NO NO NO NO NO!!!!

There are two kinds of shock, not just in NetHack but in real life.
Stick your finger in a light socket (not recommended) and you'll get
shocked.  This is one type...the type the ring of shock resistance
protects against (ie ELECTRICITY)...the *other* kind of shock, the
kind you died from, is "system shock"...in other words, your body
couldn't handle the strain of having all of its molecules rearranged,
and your body just siezed up and died.  This isn't electricity, so the
ring didn't save you.  Shock of this kind in the real world is seen
when (for example) an accident victim loses a lot of blood...he goes
into shock.  Certainly that doesn't have anything to do with
electricity...

Now if you'd met up with a blue dragon, THEN the ring would save
you...for awhile.  Maybe....

